efined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The coffee hits and my energy spikes. I feel sharp for about two hours.</p></span></div><div data-rid="a3afbc50-47db-4748-bc89-9623ea61999c" class="r-1g4o4vj alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Then the crash comes.</p></span></div><div data-rid="3c8612b5-9893-43c5-ad08-f0286ef5dcdd" class="r-1o5q7ix alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-a