he same roller coaster again.</p></span></div><div data-rid="918c7916-c150-423b-85a3-59648443676b" class="r-12qig3z alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>I started wondering…</p></span></div><div data-rid="b0978827-b0e6-4eca-8197-321800153ed1" class="r-1gsyrpo alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-s