es-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>It was something I'd never considered before.</p></span></div><div data-rid="484f6e33-12e8-468c-be0b-614cbbf6a301" class="r-1sxf7tv alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-fontsize:36px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-fontweight:700;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-lineheight:44px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-letterspacing:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-6ed17c08-405c-45f2-a66f-746f4de62389-attributes-fontsize:30px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-6ed17c08-405c-45f2-a66f-746f4de62389-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-6ed17c08-405c-45f2-a66f-746f4de62389-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-6ed17c08-405c-45f2-a66f-746f4de62389-attributes-fontweight:700;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-6ed17c08-405c-45f2-a66f-746f4de62389-attributes-lineheight:36px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-6ed17c08-405c-45f2-a66f-746f4de62389-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>My Morning Routine Was Starting to Feel Like a Chore</p></span></div><picture data-rid="ae8c7f0b-d490-47d2-9063-42d1f0fd495c" class="r-19b5h20"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/5c9513ba-f476-4f7e-a2b3-6fefeed30ca6?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/5c9513ba-f476-4f7e-a2b3-6fefeed30ca6?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/5c9513ba-f476-4f7e-a2b3-6fefeed30ca6?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/be69c66f-b9c5-4cc3-94b4-2a7d87b14463/5c9513ba-f476-4f7e-a2b3-6fefeed30ca6" class="r-1ltuaqp" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="39ba25fb-7e2b-4c45-85dd-856be9bc7d88" class="r-ig7tyg alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><h2>What I didn't know was that the same functional mushrooms I'd been buying separately — lion's mane, chaga, cordyceps, maitake — could come built into something I was already using every morning: my coffee creamer.</h2></span></div><div data-rid="46d3053a-7f8d-4290-a648-9debbf88fd6d" class="r-5yt9d5 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>The only problem is that I was spending over $100 a month on separate products — and my morning felt more like a science experiment than a ritual I enjoyed.</p></span></div><div data-rid="1a9db1eb-7696-4f1a-aff6-5fa5e8e60beb" class="r-1easpa7 alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Then a friend who's a functional nutritionist told me something that changed how I think about my routine.</p></span></div><div data-rid="41e04a16-bbfc-4e8b-bfbe-efff5af4d586" class="r-1m51ift alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Many of the active compounds in these mushrooms are fat-soluble, which means they pair well with healthy fats.</p></span></div><div data-rid="d46d0683-5523-4a4d-bf40-407f0efecfad" class="r-fq1z3c alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>Turns out I didn't need to add more to my morning. I needed to simplify it.</p></span></div><div data-rid="0273065b-c8ab-435a-98ec-4cd337d9b0a3" class="r-i8s02d alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>All I needed was to pair the right adaptogens with the right fats, at the right time — in my morning coffee, which I was already drinking anyway.</p></span></div><div data-rid="ff53ce83-ab75-4af5-9ccc-6aad42d5753d" class="r-2jtq9i alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontsize:16px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-fontweight:400;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-lineheight:24px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-7da8a116-5517-48a0-a593-762867fff46a-attributes-letterspacing:undefined"><span style="width:100%"><p>I needed a creamer that gave me functional mushrooms paired with coconut milk powder with naturally occurring MCTs, all in one scoop.</p></span></div><div data-rid="de6840ca-bed2-4fe5-9a35-b88f2bd102fd" class="r-14lgx1l alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-a846ad3c-14bd-4c0b-a1a9-3ed669f5a635-attributes-color:#002f49;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-fontsize:36px;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-textdecoration:undefined;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-fontfamily:Rubik, sans-serif;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8a34-e7ca68b5ea34-attributes-fontweight:700;--replo-library-01638d32-a707-4654-8757-ac82e52afeba-styles-64859f00-8f32-4ed2-8